A type whose Is method compares its target with the Sentinel reports it without holding it: every value of the type is marked, and the entry of the Concrete Type is a Carrier.
-- args --
-is example.com/fx.ErrX a.go:@f
-- stdout --
$WORK/a.go:12:12-13: example.com/fx.ErrX in Error Set of example.com/fx.F: maybe: 1 entry could carry it (0 unresolved)
$WORK/a.go:12:24-24: concrete example.com/fx.E
	path (origin → target):
		$WORK/a.go:12:24-24: in example.com/fx.F
	marked via (origin of example.com/fx.ErrX → here):
		$WORK/a.go:5:5-9: Sentinel example.com/fx.ErrX
		$WORK/a.go:10:41-45: loaded from variable example.com/fx.ErrX
		-: a value of type example.com/fx.E is or may wrap example.com/fx.ErrX
-- stderr --
errtrace: warning: target not reachable from main/init; parameters may lack candidates
-- exit --
3
-- go.mod --
module example.com/fx

go 1.24
-- a.go --
package fx

import "errors"

var ErrX = errors.New("x")

type E struct{}

func (E) Error() string   { return "e" }
func (E) Is(t error) bool { return t == ErrX }

func /*@f*/F() error { return E{} }
